flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Prepare joined transaction history query]
    B --> C[Open DB connection]
    C --> D[Bind account number]
    D --> E[Execute query]
    E --> F{More rows?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Append created_at,type,amount string]
    G --> E
    F -- No --> H[Return history list]
    C --> I[On SQL error print stack trace]
    I --> H
    H --> J[End]
